      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No known scientific mechanism explains how a past particle lab accident alters an individual's peripheral vision to visually predict future events. Such forceful hallucinations are often better explained by psychological factors like sleep deprivation, stress from the internship, or a sleep disorder like hypnagogic hallucinations rather than direct radiation effects on hope. If you are genuinely experiencing persistent visually real phenomena, please consult a medical professional to rule out underlying health conditions.",
